00:11:32,301 --> 00:11:35,800
What kind of considerations do you have to do to preserve this cistern?

160
00:11:35,801 --> 00:11:42,300
Actually, in the process of building on top of the cistern, we really taught very carefully.

161
00:11:42,301 --> 00:11:47,139
We said, we have to keep this place in authentic size and originality.

162
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,660
So we did special kind

163
00:11:48,661 --> 00:11:49,660
of construction.

164
00:11:49,661 --> 00:11:58,660
Nakash was designed by an engineer who came up with a groundbreaking way to build the new 20,000 square foot building above while protecting the Roman cistern below.

165
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:02,920
Instead of using reinforced concrete beams, they used steel.

166
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:11,760
That's 10 to 15% less pressure on the structure below and 30% less than the older buildings that once unknowingly sat on top of the cistern.

167
00:12:11,761 --> 00:12:18,640
We built more than beams that we needed to distribute the weight of the building above,

168
00:12:18,641 --> 00:12:21,000
so not to give any pressure to the system.

169
00:12:21,001 --> 00:12:26,520
The main thing is that lighter weight, more columns to support it, steel columns.

170
00:12:26,521 --> 00:12:27,520
Exactly.

171
00:12:27,521 --> 00:12:32,800
Thirty steel beams instead of the required twenty were used to distribute the weight.

172
00:12:32,801 --> 00:12:37,820
Next, engineers actually reoriented the building and angled it so it didn't sit directly on

173
00:12:37,821 --> 00:12:39,640
the system.

174
00:12:39,641 --> 00:12:43,640
This way, only eight of the 30 beams come in contact with the cistern.

175
00:12:43,641 --> 00:12:48,520
The entire project cost 2.5 million dollars.

176
00:12:48,521 --> 00:12:51,020
Without the cistern, it would cost half that.

177
00:12:51,021 --> 00:12:54,020
There's a lot of things underground of Istanbul.

178
00:12:54,021 --> 00:12:59,760
And I believe as much as we have on ground, we have much more than that underground of

179
00:12:59,761 --> 00:13:00,760
Istanbul.

