00:14:29,321 --> 00:14:33,320
But remnants of the old city still remain beneath our feet.

196
00:14:33,321 --> 00:14:42,280
In 306 AD, Constantine was named Emperor of Rome, dubbed Constantine the Great by Christian historians for legalizing Christianity during these pagan times.

197
00:14:42,700 --> 00:14:46,460
He also successfully united the vast Roman Empire under one emperor.

198
