00:16:58,101 --> 00:17:01,640
bodies of its victims are rumored to be buried in the bowels of the Hippodrome.

226
00:17:01,641 --> 00:17:04,771
Byzantine bones, spectator seats.

227
00:17:04,772 --> 00:17:10,560
There were no bulldozers to clear away the remains, so no one

228
00:17:10,561 --> 00:17:14,349
knows for sure what they'd find layered beneath today's pavement.

229
00:17:14,350 --> 00:17:16,040
But three surviving monuments

230
00:17:16,041 --> 00:17:20,840
from the Hippodrome Spina act as the perfect gauge for determining how much the ground level

231
00:17:20,841 --> 00:17:25,020
has changed in almost 1700 years.

232
00:17:25,021 --> 00:17:29,080
If you go look down, you can see the original level of this.

