238
00:17:47,601 --> 00:17:49,340
famous Blue Mosque.

239
00:17:49,341 --> 00:17:52,140
the highest vantage point in the old city.

240
00:17:52,141 --> 00:17:55,300
This iconic mosque took the Ottomans seven years to build

241
00:17:55,301 --> 00:17:57,700
and was completed in 1616.

242
